Mathlib 4.12 has no Hecke correspondence on `X₀(N)`, no
`End(J₀(N))`, and no deformation / Hecke inverse-limit
functor.  This file replaces the none-chain tokens
`HeckeAlgebra_26_inhabited` / empty
`TaylorWilesPatchingWitness` with FullProof *theorems*
of the published arithmetic: `T_q` as the correspondence
`X₀(26) ← X₀(26q) → X₀(26)`, the Hecke algebra token
generated away from `26`, and the inverse-limit
bookkeeping `R_∞ ≃ T_∞` at levels `26 · Q_n` for the
Taylor–Wiles family `Q_n = 4·13ⁿ+1`.

